# Hardened Academic: "Whenever ONE OR MORE cards leave your graveyard" (CR 603.2c) triggers once for a batch. Bot1 puts a
# Guerrilla Gorilla into its graveyard with Entomb and casts the Academic on turn 1; on turn 3 a Lively Dirge (modes 1 and 2,
# five mana) searches for the second Gorilla and returns both to the battlefield at once. Two cards left the graveyard
# together: one trigger, one +1/+1 counter on the target (the Academic), not two. The search itself only put a card INTO the
# graveyard, which triggers nothing.

